# sin API key, y el reporte de la comparativa multi-modelo.
results/*
!results/dataset_ley_compose.json
!results/dataset_ley_grag.json
!results/dataset_faq_compose.json
!results/dataset_ley_deterministic.json
!results/compare_grag.json
